4. Interface references (no third-party source code copied)
================================================================================

The NUIST academic overview, grade detail, electricity and labor score
integrations were implemented against the publicly observable HTTP behaviour
of the corresponding NUIST services. The request/response protocol was
cross-checked against the public project below in order to verify field names
and endpoints:

  nuist-sta-app
    Repository: https://github.com/DuoHuo/nuist-sta-app
    Reference:  commit 6e9f464 (Dart/Flutter)
    License:    NONE DECLARED

That reference project declares no open-source license. Therefore no source
code from it may be copied, translated or otherwise incorporated into this
repository; only independently written implementations of the observed
network protocol are permitted.

The upstream school-adapter repository and the third-party `kgit` coordinate
(io.github.xingheyuzhuan:kgit) are used as published dependencies and are not
modified by this repository.

